d "7ab95026-35d0-5991-bf3d-193491fa5be0" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 21\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-7 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=21\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} &=-16 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=8$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(8) &=-9 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=8$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=21 \\\\ 2(-1)+3(8) &=21 \\\\ 22 &=21\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution."] [:db/add "7ab95026-35d0-5991-bf3d-193491fa5be0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "7ab95026-35d0-5991-bf3d-193491fa5be0" :question/answer-fields "2f0ffb10-601d-5ac5-b716-350a7204840a"] [:db/ensure "7ab95026-35d0-5991-bf3d-193491fa5be0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/questions "7ab95026-35d0-5991-bf3d-193491fa5be0"] [:db/add "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c" :answer/id #uuid "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c"] [:db/add "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c" :answer/value "21"] [:db/ensure "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb" :answer/id #uuid "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb"] [:db/add "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb" :answer/value "16"] [:db/ensure "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882" :answer/id #uuid "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882"] [:db/add "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882" :answer/value "10"] [:db/ensure "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8" :answer/id #uuid "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8"] [:db/add "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8" :answer/value "12"] [:db/ensure "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944" :answer/id #uuid "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944"] [:db/add "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944" :answer/value "No solution"] [:db/ensure "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944" :answer/validate] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/id #uuid "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/choices "24914a08-6ca2-5979-81ba-1266e5384c9c"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/choices "6bf83955-1a76-5c4d-a7e5-17c02bde0beb"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/choices "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/choices "bb577678-5bca-5273-8fe9-a9073fa7cec8"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/choices "2782144a-f583-5f44-bf8f-7dd00d00c944"] [:db/add "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/correct "c074cc67-5110-57b1-b8c1-bc9f3e5ce882"] [:db/ensure "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/id #uuid "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec"] [:db/add "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$"] [:db/add "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-14 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} &=-14 \\\\ -{x}_{2} &=-4 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we get ${x}_{2}=4$.\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-8{x}_{2} &=-14 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-8(4) &=-14 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} &=18 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=6$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=4 \\\\ -2(6)+4(4) &=4 \\\\ 4 &=4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement.\n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=6$ and ${x}_{2}=4$, which means\n\n$$\n6{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(6)+(4)=10.\n$$"] [:db/add "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/answer-fields "02ecddd5-c526-508a-8258-5b17d18d93c8"] [:db/ensure "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/questions "8ba31d16-ec9d-553c-9311-9b450daca5ec"] [:db/add "c1f82248-a0c2-51f0-ab73-fdd0225cce8f" :answer/id #uuid "c1f82248-a0c2-51f0-ab73-fdd0225cce8f"] [:db/add "c1f82248-a0c2-51f0-ab73-fdd0225cce8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c1f82248-a0c2-51f0-ab73-fdd0225cce8f" :answer/value "-7"] [:db/ensure "c1f82248-a0c2-51f0-ab73-fdd0225cce8f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca" :answer/id #uuid "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca"] [:db/add "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca" :answer/value "-2"] [:db/ensure "fed157de-fd69-583d-ae90-d1b7f576fcca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "41bef361-971c-56d8-ae3d-27823ba753de" :answer/id #uuid "41bef361-971c-56d8-ae3d-27823ba753de"] [:db/add "41bef361-971c-56d8-ae3d-27823ba753de" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "41bef361-971c-56d8-ae3d-27823ba753de" :answer/value "No solution"] [:db/ensure "41bef361-971c-56d8-ae3d-27823ba753de" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5a6a38a0-25d7-5700-a747-f0946f89a9ab" :answer/id #uuid "5a6a38a0-25d7-5700-a747-f0946f89a9ab"] [:db/add "5a6a38a0-25d7-5700-a747-f0946f89a9ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5a6a38a0-25d7-5700-a747-f0946f89a9ab" :answer/value "-1"] [:db/ensure "5a6a38a0-25d7-5700-a747-f0946f89a9