\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} &=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-6 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=2 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} &=-4 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=2$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(2) &=-6 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4 \\\\ {x}_{1} &=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-4$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=-2 \\\\ 2(-4)+3(2) &=-2 \\\\ -2 &=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement.\n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-4$ and ${x}_{2}=2$, which means\n\n$$\n-4{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(-4)+(2)=-2.\n$$"] [:db/add "bdf48f7c-668a-565f-9d26-2ee7cfe82070" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "bdf48f7c-668a-565f-9d26-2ee7cfe82070" :question/answer-fields "fe48ae11-3f8c-576a-bfbd-5ad6f7a3e449"] [:db/ensure "bdf48f7c-668a-565f-9d26-2ee7cfe82070" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/questions "bdf48f7c-668a-565f-9d26-2ee7cfe82070"] [:db/add "31310c10-5a20-573a-b91e-c053a759f650" :answer/id #uuid "31310c10-5a20-573a-b91e-c053a759f650"] [:db/add "31310c10-5a20-573a-b91e-c053a759f650" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "31310c10-5a20-573a-b91e-c053a759f650" :answer/value "1"] [:db/e