{x}_{2} &=6 \\\\ -(-1)+2(2) &=6 \\\\ 5 &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement.\n\nSo, the system has no solution."] [:db/add "7080715d-521e-5a43-9f55-40ddaf77bf62" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "7080715d-521e-5a43-9f55-40ddaf77bf62" :question/answer-fields "e365304b-ea02-5e2a-bbbe-51ee320976e3"] [:db/ensure "7080715d-521e-5a43-9f55-40ddaf77bf62" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/questions "7080715d-521e-5a43-9f55-40ddaf77bf62"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "027c17cb-ef00-596d-80d6-9a0189bcf9cc"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/46/4606a2ad29de149fe347662787fb0e2b356e433ec1ba73d399c6e787ce9a63e9/17592186119807.py"] [:db/add 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/validate]]
